    <string name="onboarding_1_body">VHS Cam turns your phone into a 90s camcorder: a modern camera with footage straight from the past.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_title">A camera for every era</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_body">VHS, an early-2000s digicam, 35mm film, instant film, 8-bit, a 2005 webcam and CCTV.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_title">Camcorder buttons</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_body">Fader, night vision, sepia and mosaic, digital zoom, interval REC, dual recording and the VCR blue screen.</string>
